rum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/551489-court-creation?p=567260#post567260\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Okay, legit question: How likely am I to find a decently paying job with a English Major/Visual Comm Minor Bachelor of Arts in Japan?<br /> <br /> If you know the answer for New York as well, that would also be appreciated.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hit me up by email. I'll chat you up about it. <br /> <br /> Long story short: If you have a Bachelor's in English, pretty damned good.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>David A Hill Jr </b><br /> Freelance Writer<br /> Independent Game Designer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/70-machineiv","name":"MachineIV","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar70_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1791"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-24T20:16:32-07:00","id":567275,"title":"","content":"And done.<br /> <br /> QUestion to the room: What do you think an occult story engine would demand of the role of the Maiden, Wild One, and Woodsman?<br /> <br /> Right now, I have that they must be a friend of the Courts, via at least having Court Goodwill(by the way, the lack of stuff on Courtless is really stumping me when I hit the idea that Courtless Freeholders can still be in the Roles), and a fulfillment of a virture tied to the roles as determined by the Storyteller, alongside an approval from each Court(hence the Duels).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa,